# =============================================================================
# FLIGHT SCHEDULES
# =============================================================================
# The app never calls a flight vendor directly. Schedule lookups go through the
# Nhost function POST /v1/client/flights/search, which owns the provider keys and
# the shared schedule cache. Configure RAPIDAPI_KEY, AVIATIONSTACK_API_KEY,
# FLIGHT_PROVIDER, and FLIGHT_SELECTION_SIGNING_SECRET as Nhost secrets instead.